{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528921673,"sessionID":"ses_e2dc4377affeMLBMP15YBCIej5","part":{"id":"prt_1d2423980002XZMG6yO6aJWERJ","sessionID":"ses_e2dc4377affeMLBMP15YBCIej5","messageID":"msg_1d242272c001S4SuZeaSuocURU","type":"text","text":"T016 implemented in `command-offer.mjs` and its vitest file. `backfillRunLog` now resolves every prompt before writing, warms each checkout once, replays with `backfill-<rowId>`, records `offeredCommand`, `offeredPolicy`, `offerError`, `briefDelivered` and `offerBackfilled`, refuses `same_path` and coded prompt lookups with no output file, and marks a missing checkout `no_checkout`.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts`\n\n**Verify (VO) output**\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  11 passed (11)\n   Start at  01:14:44\n   Duration  111ms (transform 35ms, setup 12ms, import 37ms, tests 5ms, environment 0ms)\n```\nBaseline was 7 passed, now 11. `node --check` on the module also exits 0. The four new cases cover the two-line log with one warm per checkout, the `no_checkout` line, the refused holdout id and `same_path`.\n\n**Not done**\n- The shared-socket override was skipped because `scratch/socket-key.txt` ends `per-checkout`. The condition in the task is false, so `warm` and `replay` leave `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` inherited.\n- The default `warmCheckout` was not exercised against a live checkout, because that would start a daemon and the task's verify does not ask for a live run. Its command matches the task text and the injected-warm path is covered.\n\n`SKILL ROUTING: sk-code → sk-code-skilled`, JavaScript standards and implement/verify doctrine loaded. `REPO RULES: prevent-overengineering.md, communication.md, communication-handoff.md`.\n\nNothing is blocked on you. I did not tick the T016 checkbox and touched no other file.","time":{"start":1794528917888,"end":1794528921673}}}
